 "text": "A whole box of 50 masks. Let me show you why. Sweep out the garage or shake out a rug and look at all that dust. You're breathing that too. These are KN95s, so they filter out 95% or more, and they're made to be soft on your skin. They're shaped like a fish to fit your face, and the loops stretch. Each one is wrapped, so keep a few in the car and a few in the garage. The only problem? Now I can't say I forgot my mask. It's leaf season, so don't put this off. Grab a couple boxes so there's always one close. It's in the orange cart.",
